Get to know the rules of football
Do you want to become a (better) referee? Are you a football player, fan, coach or journalist? Do you want to review a situation while watching a match on TV or live in the stadium? Then you need to know the Laws of the Game!

The Laws of the Game - accessible to everyone
Our app allows you to:
- read the full Laws of the Game on your mobile device (online and offline);
- compare the latest rules with the previous edition and see what has changed;
- read all the recent Law changes including detailed explanations;
- test your knowledge in the Q&A section;
- add your own notes and mark favourite chapters;
- easily switch between languages and/or Laws editions.

Jumping rope is one of the most popular cardio exercises. Jumping rope is useful both for weight loss and for improving the functional qualities of the athlete. They are used in almost every sport: fitness, martial arts, crossfit and many others.

The rope is a very compact sports equipment that does not take up much space. You can always take it with you outside or even on vacation.

The training program for 1000 jumping rope is based on the principle of progressive growth of the exercise. And even if now you can do just a few jumps, in a couple of weeks you will be able to increase your result by an order of magnitude.

Application functions:
- levels from 0 to 1000 repetitions;
- training history
- quick statistics;
- achievements;
- reminders;
